- Use isolates for image processing
- Consider image compression settings
- Cache or reuse conversion logic when possible

Error handling suggestions:
- Implement fallback mechanisms
- Log conversion errors
- Provide user-friendly error messages

By following this approach, you can reliably convert CameraImage to PNG in Flutter across different devices and image formats.

